This was the castle of famous feudal warlord Nobunaga Oda.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There are only stone walls and stairs were left, but I guess it is what is called decadentism, the place has a nice atmosphere.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From the tower ruin, you can overlook the townscape and the lakescape.&lt;/p&gt;
